    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Readme\n### Load your data into a vector database from your Google Drive, and then use your data as context for your own knowledge assistant.\n\n1. Connect your Google and OpenAI credentials in the highlighted nodes. \n\n**Note** Once you connect your credentials, you will be able to use those credentials repeatedly in the nodes for the same service. e.g. Google Drive credentials can be reused in each Google Drive node. \n\n2. Check that your required files are in the correct Google Drive Folder. \n\n3. Execute the workflow to begin loading your Vector Store. \n\n4. Test is out with the Chatbot Interface!\n\nOnce you are ready, set the workflow to \"active\" the workflow will periodically check for new Drive Files. \n\n**Note** You can adjust the frequency of checks in the Google Drive File Monitor node. ",
        "height": 492,
        "width": 536,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -400,
        64
      ],
